  "html": "<h1>Release Notes</h1>\n<!-- confluence-toc -->\n<p>See the <a href=\"sibling.md\">upgrade guide</a> before starting.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[!WARNING] Back up your data before upgrading.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>What's New</h2>\n<p>A soft-wrapped paragraph describing the release across multiple source lines that collapse into one.</p>\n<p><img src=\"assets/logo.png\" alt=\"the new dashboard\" title=\"{&quot;width&quot;: &quot;480&quot;, &quot;align&quot;: &quot;center&quot;}\" /></p>\n<h2>Configuration</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Setting</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Default</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">retries</td>\n<td align=\"left\">3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">timeout</td>\n<td align=\"left\">30s</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">config = {&quot;retries&quot;: 3, &quot;timeout&quot;: &quot;30s&quot;}\n</code></pre>\n<p>A pasted status macro: &lt;ac:structured-macro ac:name=&quot;status&quot; ac:schema-version=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;ac:parameter ac:name=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Stable&lt;/ac:parameter&gt;&lt;/ac:structured-macro&gt;</p>\n",
